        <div class="c-event-card__content">
            <h3 class="c-col-title c-event-card__title">
                On Tour in New York            </h3>

                            <p class="c-event-card__subtitle">Sir Antonio Pappano, Maxim Vengerov, Alisa Weilerstein & Kirill Gerstein</p>
            
            <p class="c-event-card__date">Sunday 14 March 2027 • 2pm</p>

            <p class="c-event-card__excerpt">In this Sunday matinee, Sir Antonio Pappano conducts the London Symphony Orchestra in Beethoven’s rarely heard Triple Concerto, joined by soloists Maxim Vengerov, Alisa Weilerstein and Kirill Gerstein. </p>

